title: Press
subtitle: The party press: a campaign over several groups, reportage, an open debate, an investigation or its format.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_media.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.partyReady(Q) && Q.S.chapter.status !== 'ended' !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.media (technical reference 5.3, 10.6, 13.2; card catalogue 5.3). Z — 0.77 (decisions of 8 X 2026): the Press card;
// the campaigns among chosen voters moved to the new Campaign card (polish_party_campaign). One option, 1 T; the debate costs no
// resource. The card rests three months after use (Z — 0.76). Z — 0.90 (decision 4A of 24 X 2026): full sentences about the press,
// its readers and their trust; the press strengthens the campaigns of the Campaign card, a government of the right may confiscate.
PolishParty.pressView(Q);
!}

= Press

[+ pl_press_intro +]

- @press_campaign
- @reportage
- @debate
- @investigation
- @format
- @easy_discard

@press_campaign
title: The press in the service of the campaign
subtitle: [+ pl_press_campaign_effect +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.pressActionStatus(Q, 'campaign').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_press_campaign_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.pressCampaign(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@reportage
title: Reportage on the conditions of work and life
subtitle: One unit of the party's money. The workers and the unemployed trust PPS more (+3), so the next campaigns among them are stronger; the press gains credibility (+2).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.pressActionStatus(Q, 'reportage').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_press_reportage_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.pressReportage(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@debate
title: An open debate in the columns of the press
subtitle: Costs no money. The factions argue in the columns of the press, and the dissent of each falls (−3).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.pressActionStatus(Q, 'debate').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_press_debate_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.pressDebate(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@investigation
title: A press investigation
subtitle: [+ pl_press_investigation_line +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.pressInvestigationStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_media_investigation_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.pressInvestigation(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@format
title: [+ pl_media_format_title +]
subtitle: [+ pl_media_format_line +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.pressFormatStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_media_format_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.pressFormatChoose(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Press

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
